---@field caching? anthropic.beta_messages.BetaCacheControlEphemeral|distilled.Null Caching for the advisor's own prompt. When set, each advisor call writes a cache entry at the given TTL so subsequent calls in the same conversation read the stable prefix. When omitted, the advisor prompt is not cached.
