---@field max_tokens? number|distilled.Null Bounds the advisor's total output (thinking + text) per call. When the advisor hits this cap, the returned advisor_result or advisor_redacted_result block carries stop_reason='max_tokens', and a truncation note is appended to the advice text the worker model sees (inside the encrypted blob in redacted mode). When set, the API also passes the advisor its remaining-token budget, so the advisor shapes its output toward the cap. When omitted, the advisor model's default output cap applies and the API doesn't pass a budget.
---@field max_uses? number|distilled.Null Maximum number of times the tool can be used in the API request.
